[options]

[A.]
                                                <h2>Congratulations! <a href="#mission30">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
<br>
You've made it all the way through the Campaign! Well done! Even when there was overwhelming odds
 against you, and with the evil {sw_hades} betraying you in the end, you were able
 to win your freedom!
<p>
Priests from all over come to welcome you! A special BULF envoy will deliver you to your
welcoming party!
<p>
            ~[Ipriest.84]     ~[IBulf.76]         ~[IBulf.27]      ~[Ibulf.73]       ~[IBulf.24]         ~[IBulf.50]<br>
Bulfs? Err you ask if there is something else to pick you up. For BULFs are slow
 and BULFs are stoopid, and they're not comfortable to ride on.... and...
<p>
<i>"Nonsense!"~., declares your ally. <i>"Come join us in Celebration. Take a BULF ride over
 to our island. Believe me, you won't regret it!"~.
<p>
~I"Well"~., you think to yourself. ~I"The party looks like real fun..."<br>
                   "And it is a Celebration for me....."<br>
"How would it look, if the Guest of Honor wasn't at his own party?"
<p>
~.OK! You agree to catch a ride to the Priest's island. After all, what could possibbly happen?
 The island's only a minute away. You could walk over...
