[@47]
<$MoveDialog,tl>
After waking up in the Hospital a week later, with just about every bone broken in your body,
you KNEW YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE AGREED TO BE PICKED UP BY A BULF!
<p>
You hope you make a speedy recovery, so you can join the Celebration (which is still
 going on!
$Button=More,Tell,dne

[dne]
                                          This ends THE BOWELS OF ~r~[Ipriest.103]~[IsunFlyerBomb.0]HELL~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~[Ipriest.133]~.
<br>
                                                     We hope you enjoyed it!
<p>
This is only one of a number of paths you can take in this Campaign. If you would
 like, go to THE BOWELS OF ~r~[Ipriest.103]~[IsunFlyerBomb.0]HELL~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~[Ipriest.133]~.
 and select the RESET button. Then you can replay the Campaign over and try different things!
<p>
There are about 30 Maps in this Campaign with lots and lots of time spent making this.
 Indeed, Highlander and I spent close to a month making it! If you have any comments or
 (hint hint) praise, please E-mail us. We'd appreciate it!
<p>
                               A joint venture ~[Ipriest.101]<a href="cmd:MissionBegin,sw_m51">~[Imog.15]</a>~[Ipriest.133] by: ~B~I~ySwelbLander~.<br><br>
